				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be put in motion, move,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				30
			</span></i>; of <i>mincing</i> gait, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				688
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>throw into disorder, confound,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πεπραγμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.25
				</span></i>
