					Plu.
					<u>CG</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γνώμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					2.36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sift thoroughly, scrutinize,</i>
			
